## API Overview

**Base URL (Internal):** `https://api.merawork.com/api/v1/`  
**Base URL (Integration):** `https://api.merawork.com/api/integration/v1/`  
**Version:** v1  
**.NET Framework:** .NET 6

The MeraWork API provides comprehensive workforce management and monitoring capabilities. The API supports both internal and external (partner) integrations with robust security mechanisms including JWT authentication, API Key validation, rate limiting, and webhook signature verification.

### API Versions

- **Internal API** (`/api/v1/*`) - Used by internal applications and authenticated users
- **Public/Integration API** (`/api/integration/v1/*`) - Used by external partners and integrations

