## Support & Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

**Issue:** 401 Unauthorized with valid token
- Check token expiry time
- Verify JWT signing key matches configuration
- Check if session has been revoked
- Ensure HTTPS is being used in production

**Issue:** 429 Rate Limit Exceeded
- Check your request frequency
- Implement exponential backoff
- Wait for `Retry-After` duration before retrying
- Check if using multiple API keys with same IP

**Issue:** Webhook signature validation failing
- Ensure raw payload is used (not parsed/serialized)
- Check signature header name (X-Razorpay-Signature vs X-Signature)
- Verify webhook secret is correct
- Check request encoding (should be UTF-8)

**Issue:** 400 Validation Error**
- Review all required fields in documentation
- Check data types match expected format
- Validate field lengths and patterns
- Ensure JSON is well-formed

